      "p0001-n0010-l0005"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "As global ocean temperatures rises, Scottish herring and mackerel may migrate away from their current habitat near Scotland, which is undoubtedly a huge blow to Scottish fisheries. As a special consultant hired by the Scottish North Atlantic Fisheries Management Association, we will conduct an in-depth analysis of this situation."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000010",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
